  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidating Sudan Call: Training, Technical Assistance, and Capacity Building for Civil Society Organizations and Institutions in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program provides support and facilitation for a national political dialogue in Sudan through engagement of the Sudan Call (a grouping of Sudanese political opposition and civil society groups), as well as consultation services and capacity building to political party institutions and civil society organizations that are a part of the Sudan Call.</narrative>
  </description>
